  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Thrill Seekers" id="1674-23e6-eacf-9624" hidden="false">
      <description>If your Army Faction is **^^Emperor&apos;s Children^^**, this unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced or Fell Back, but when doing so:
- It cannot target a unit it was within Engagement Range of at the start of the turn
- It cannot target a unit that was the target of another unit&apos;s charge or attack this phase.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
