        <profile name="Symphony of Subjugation" id="8119-af09-5937-c6a7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the Fights phase, select one enemy unit within 12&quot; of this model. That unit must take a Leadership test. If that test is failed, until the end of the phase: That unit cannot use or benefit from Stratagems and subtracts 1 from Hit rolls made by models in that unit. Each time this model makes an attack that targets that unit, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged: 1-8 wounds remaining" id="258d-a8bd-9a71-c789" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model has 1-8 wounds remaining, subtract 4 from this model’s Objective Control characteristic and each time this model makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
