          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time this model is selected to shoot, it can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the phase improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of its ranged weapons by 1, and each time an attack made by this model scores a Critical Wound, that attack inflicts 1 mortal wound in addition to normal damage. After resolving its attacks, this model suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
