                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per turn, in your Movement phase, the bearer can use this Enhancement. If it does, select one friendly **^^Emperor&apos;s Children Transport**^^ that is in Strategic Reserves. Until the end of the phase, for the purposes of setting up that **^^Transport**^^ on the battlefield, treat the current battle round number as being one higher than it actually is.</characteristic>
