              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of the battle, for each model from your Crusade army with this Battle Trait that is on the battlefield, roll one D6: for each 3-5, you gain 1 Common ingredient; for each 6, you gain 1 Rare ingredient.</characteristic>
