              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit gains the **^^Smoke^^** and **^^Grenades^^** keywords. If it already has the **^^Grenades^^** keyword, then once per battle, you can target this unit with either the Smokescreen or Grenade Stratagem for 0CP. After resolving the effects of that Stratagem, each enemy unit within 6&quot; of this unit must take a Battle-shock test.</characteristic>
