              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, after this model&apos;s unit has shot, select one enemy ^^**Infantry**^^ unit hit by one or more of those attacks and roll three D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound. If an enemy unit suffers one or more mortal wounds as a result of this ability, it must take a Battle-shock test.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
